</p></list-item><list-item><p>V series (venomous agents)
<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>VX and VR</p></list-item></list>
</p></list-item><list-item><p>A series (advanced)
<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>A-230</p></list-item><list-item><p>A-232</p></list-item><list-item><p>A-234</p></list-item></list>
